      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IMPRESS NEMO (1) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 2 lengths behind Soul Surfer in 17.43 and recording a new PB here. Happy to have him on top here. TELLING TALES (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind FINUCANE (17.19) in a Novice race. Hard to beat again. TERRA FIRMA (3) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a neck (17.39) behind Cash For Fun at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expecting another good run. INTENSE FLARE (8) is in form and must include among the chances.",
